.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Seeded candle caches and reports are local, EXCEPT the two files the
# determinism gate reads. The gate is the migration's proof that behaviour did
# not change, and it is worthless if its inputs live only on one machine.
# Git cannot re-include through an excluded directory, so each level is
# unwound explicitly. M1/H4/D1 stay ignored: no gate case reads them.
data/*
!data/candles/
data/candles/*
!data/candles/XAUUSD/
data/candles/XAUUSD/*
!data/candles/XAUUSD/M15.jsonl
!data/candles/XAUUSD/H1.jsonl
logs/
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
node_modules/
